#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example is used in later sections of this topic to illustrate that the coupling map and supported instruction set are the essential pieces of information to pass to the transpiler for optimal circuit construction. The QPU can usually select default settings for other information that is not passed in, such as timing and scheduling.\n"
